[{"text":"Explicit[exp] inserts explicit expressions of GluonVertex, Twist2GluonOperator, SUNF etc. in exp.","anchor":"explicit"},{"text":"To rewrite the \\(SU(N)\\) structure constants in terms of traces, please set the corresponding options SUNF or SUND to True.","anchor":"explicit"},{"text":"Explicit is also an option for FieldStrength, GluonVertex, SUNF, Twist2GluonOperator etc. If set to True the full form of the operator is inserted.","anchor":"explicit"},{"text":"Overview, GluonVertex, Twist2GluonOperator.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"gv = GluonVertex[p, \\[Mu], a, q, \\[Nu], b, r, \\[Rho], c]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[f^{abc} V^{\\mu \\nu \\rho }(p\\text{, }q\\text{, }r)\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Explicit[gv]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[g_s f^{abc} \\left(g^{\\mu \\nu } \\left(p^{\\rho }-q^{\\rho }\\right)+g^{\\mu \\rho } \\left(r^{\\nu }-p^{\\nu }\\right)+g^{\\nu \\rho } \\left(q^{\\mu }-r^{\\mu }\\right)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Explicit[gv, SUNF -> True]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[2 i g_s \\left(\\text{tr}\\left(T^a.T^c.T^b\\right)-\\text{tr}\\left(T^a.T^b.T^c\\right)\\right) \\left(g^{\\mu \\nu } \\left(p^{\\rho }-q^{\\rho }\\right)+g^{\\mu \\rho } \\left(r^{\\nu }-p^{\\nu }\\right)+g^{\\nu \\rho } \\left(q^{\\mu }-r^{\\mu }\\right)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Twist2GluonOperator[p, \\[Mu], a, \\[Nu], b] Explicit[%]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{2} \\left((-1)^m+1\\right) \\delta ^{ab} \\left(O_{\\mu \\, \\nu }^{\\text{G2}}(p)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{2} \\left((-1)^m+1\\right) \\delta ^{ab} (\\Delta \\cdot p)^{m-2} \\left(g^{\\mu \\nu } (\\Delta \\cdot p)^2+p^2 \\Delta ^{\\mu } \\Delta ^{\\nu }-(\\Delta \\cdot p) \\left(\\Delta ^{\\nu } p^{\\mu }+\\Delta ^{\\mu } p^{\\nu }\\right)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FieldStrength[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], a] Explicit[%]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[F_{\\mu \\nu }^a\\]","anchor":"cb5-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[g_s f^{a\\text{b19}\\;\\text{c20}} A_{\\mu }^{\\text{b19}}.A_{\\nu }^{\\text{c20}}+\\left(\\partial _{\\mu }A_{\\nu }^a\\right)-\\left(\\partial _{\\nu }A_{\\mu }^a\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb5-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Explicit[SUNF[a, b, c]]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[f^{abc}\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Explicit[SUNF[a, b, c], SUNF -> True]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[2 i \\left(\\text{tr}\\left(T^a.T^c.T^b\\right)-\\text{tr}\\left(T^a.T^b.T^c\\right)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Explicit[SUND[a, b, c]]","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[d^{abc}\\]","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Explicit[SUND[a, b, c], SUND -> True]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[2 \\;\\text{tr}\\left(T^a.T^b.T^c\\right)+2 \\;\\text{tr}\\left(T^b.T^a.T^c\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb9-1","section":"Examples"}]